    "description": "Stylish 3-bedroom townhouse with private pool in quiet Umalas, 10 min to the beach by scooter. Modern tropical design, peaceful street, great cafes nearby. 140 m2 with three balcony bedrooms, Wi-Fi 200 Mbps, workspaces, Smart TV and fully equipped kitchen. Perfect for families, groups, digital nomads and long stays.\n\nThis spacious 140 m2 townhouse spans two floors and is designed for comfortable Bali living — combining coziness, privacy and modern tropical design. On the upper floor are three bright suite bedrooms, each with its own bathroom and balcony. On the ground floor, the living room opens directly to the fully private pool. The house is fully air-conditioned and suits both short holidays and long-term stays.\n\nWhat's included: private pool, fast Wi-Fi 200 Mbps, comfortable workspaces for remote work, Smart TV (Netflix, Apple TV, YouTube — use your own account), fully equipped kitchen with stove, microwave, coffee machine, blender and kettle, washing machine, safe, iron and ironing board."
